      "CHIYO: Satsu!\nSATSU: Chiyo-chan!",
      "CHIYO: Let me go! Let me go!\nYOUNG PUMPKIN: Shhh. Stop that. Mother will hear you; she's got a bamboo stick.\nCHIYO: I want my sister!\nYOUNG PUMPKIN: I cried, too, at first. You know, it 'is easier if you just forget everything that happened before you came to the okiya. If you impress Mot…",
      "CHIYO: A what?\nHATSUMOMO: Why can't you be QUIET?",
      "CHIYO: When can I go outside?\nYOUNG PUMPKIN: Outside the okiya? You can't. It's not allowed.\nYOUNG PUMPKIN: Look.",
      "PUMPKIN: Hurry!\nCHIYO: Pumpkin! I'm sorry; I'm going to run-- I'm going to find Satsu--\nYOUNG PUMPKIN: No! Chiyo, don't! You will ruin your own chances, and mine too! Please. Stay with me!\nPUMPKIN: Mite, mite!"
    ]
